  "notes": [
    "Overlay 1 of 6 in the remaining-userscripts modernization roadmap.",
    "Built from the latest confirmed repository state: all six LPSG overlays plus Bleeding Cool OV01-OV03.",
    "This overlay supersedes the previously generated but unconfirmed bleedingcool_regression_release_seal_ov04_v1.zip by carrying its release-seal changes forward on top of the LPSG-aware baseline; do not apply that older OV04 after this overlay.",
